Package: mate-clipboard
Architecture: any
Depends: mate-panel,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: clipboard manager applet for the MATE panel
 Clipman keeps an encrypted history of clipboard entries and shows it in a
 popup from the MATE panel. It supports X11 and, through the wlr and ext
 data-control protocols with gtk-layer-shell, Wayland sessions.
 .
 The applet is loaded in-process by mate-panel.
